---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Food Safety Certification Services | Eurocert"
  description="Explore Eurocert food safety certification services including FSSC 22000, ISO 22000, HACCP, GLOBALG.A.P., BRCGS, IFS and GHP."
  canonicalUrl="https://www.eurocert.asia/food-certification/"
  ogImage="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367859/eurocert/Untitled_design_19_.png.png"
  keywords="Eurocert,Eurocert Asia,ISO certification,CE marking,food safety certification,FSSC 22000,BRCGS,GFSI,social audits,Sedex,SMETA,SA8000,inspection services,certification body,India,management systems,ISO 9001,ISO 14001,ISO 45001"
>
<style is:global>@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:900;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-solid-900.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Brands";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-brands-400.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-regular-400.woff2) format('woff2')}</style>
<section class="relative min-h-[50vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16]"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367874/eurocert/ad4.jpg.jpg" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-25" alt="Food Certification Hero"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030a16]/80 via-transparent to-[#030a16]"></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-center py-24"><h4 data-reveal="reveal-up" class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-6 font-bold">Food Safety Excellence Nodes Active</h4><h1 data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="150" class="heading-font text-5xl sm:text-7xl md:text-8xl font-bold text-white mb-4 tracking-tight" style="text-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(212,168,67,0.4)">Food Certification</h1><h3 data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="250" class="heading-font text-white/80 text-base md:text-xl uppercase tracking-[0.3em] mb-4">Services</h3><div data-reveal="reveal-scale" data-reveal-delay="350" class="w-24 h-0.5 bg-eurogold-400 mx-auto mb-6 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(212,168,67,0.6)]"></div><p data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="450" class="text-white/90 text-sm md:text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">Ensuring food safety and quality through comprehensive certification programs</p></div></section><section class="py-16 lg:py-20 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 data-reveal="reveal-up" class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-3 font-bold">Comprehensive Programs</h4><h2 data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="150" class="heading-font text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Our Food Certifications</h2></div><div class="space-y-16 lg:space-y-20"><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-center"><div data-reveal="reveal-left" class="relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-[0_25px_60px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.12)] border border-slate-200 group h-[280px] sm:h-[360px] "><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367593/eurocert/F1.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-1000 group-hover:scale-110" alt="IFS"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#030a16]/60 via-transparent to-transparent"></div><div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5"><span class="inline-block px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md text-eurogold-400 text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] rounded-full border border-eurogold-400/30 heading-font">Food Safety Matrix // 01</span></div></div><div data-reveal="reveal-right" data-reveal-delay="200" class="space-y-6 "><div><h3 class="heading-font text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 leading-tight tracking-tight">IFS</h3><p class="heading-font text-euro-600 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mt-1">Certification</p></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">The International Featured Standards (IFS) are food safety and quality standards recognized by the Global Food Safety Initiative (GFSI). IFS certification demonstrates your commitment to food safety and quality management.</p><div class="pt-2"><ul class="space-y-3"><li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(212,168,67,0.5)] shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg>IFS Food Standard for food manufacturers</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(212,168,67,0.5)] shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg>IFS Logistics for logistics companies</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(212,168,67,0.5)] shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg>IFS Broker for brokers and traders</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(212,168,67,0.5)] shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg>Comprehensive audit and certification services</li></ul></div><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 bg-euro-600 text-white heading-font text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest rounded-2xl hover:bg-euro-700 transition shadow-xl mt-2" href="/food-certification/ifs/">Learn More IFS<i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[9px]"></i></a></div></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-center"><div data-reveal="reveal-right" class="relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-[0_25px_60px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.12)] border border-slate-200 group h-[280px] sm:h-[360px] md:order-2"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367659/eurocert/F2.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-1000 group-hover:scale-110" alt="GLOBALGAP"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#030a16]/60 via-transparent to-transparent"></div><div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5"><span class="inline-block px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md text-eurogold-400 text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] rounded-full border border-eurogold-400/30 heading-font">Farm Assurance // 02</span></div></div><div data-reveal="reveal-left" data-reveal-delay="200" class="space-y-6 md:order-1"><div><h3 class="heading-font text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 leading-tight tracking-tight">GLOBALGAP</h3><p class="heading-font text-euro-600 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mt-1">Certification</p></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">GLOBALGAP is a leading farm assurance program that sets voluntary standards for the certification of agricultural products worldwide. It ensures safe and sustainable agricultural practices.</p><div class="pt-2"><ul class="space-y-3"><li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(212,168,67,0.5)] shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg>Crop production standards</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(212,168,67,0.5)] shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg>Livestock standards</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(212,168,67,0.5)] shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg>Aquaculture standards</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(212,168,67,0.5)] shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg>Chain of custody certification</li></ul></div><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 bg-euro-600 text-white heading-font text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest rounded-2xl hover:bg-euro-700 transition shadow-xl mt-2" href="/food-certification/globalgap/">Learn More GLOBALGAP<i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[9px]"></i></a></div></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-center"><div data-reveal="reveal-left" class="relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-[0_25px_60px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.12)] border border-slate-200 group h-[280px] sm:h-[360px] "><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367664/eurocert/F3.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-1000 group-hover:scale-110" alt="HACCP"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#030a16]/60 via-transparent to-transparent"></div><div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5"><span class="inline-block px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md text-eurogold-400 text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] rounded-full border border-eurogold-400/30 heading-font">Hazard Control // 03</span></div></div><div data-reveal="reveal-right" data-reveal-delay="200" class="space-y-6 "><div><h3 class="heading-font text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 leading-tight tracking-tight">HACCP</h3><p class="heading-font text-euro-600 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mt-1">Certification</p></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">Hazard Analysis and Critical Control Points (HACCP) is a systematic preventive approach to food safety that identifies, evaluates, and controls hazards in food production.</p><div class="pt-2"><ul class="space-y-3"><li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(212,168,67,0.5)] shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg>HACCP system development and implementation</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(212,168,67,0.5)] shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg>HACCP training and certification</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(212,168,67,0.5)] shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg>HACCP audits and verification</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(212,168,67,0.5)] shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg>Compliance with food safety regulations</li></ul></div><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 bg-euro-600 text-white heading-font text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest rounded-2xl hover:bg-euro-700 transition shadow-xl mt-2" href="/food-certification/haccp/">Learn More HACCP<i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[9px]"></i></a></div></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-center"><div data-reveal="reveal-right" class="relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-[0_25px_60px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.12)] border border-slate-200 group h-[280px] sm:h-[360px] md:order-2"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367669/eurocert/F4.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-1000 group-hover:scale-110" alt="FSSC 22000"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#030a16]/60 via-transparent to-transparent"></div><div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5"><span class="inline-block px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md text-eurogold-400 text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] rounded-full border border-eurogold-400/30 heading-font">GFSI Recognized // 04</span></div></div><div data-reveal="reveal-left" data-reveal-delay="200" class="space-y-6 md:order-1"><div><h3 class="heading-font text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 leading-tight tracking-tight">FSSC 22000</h3><p class="heading-font text-euro-600 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mt-1">Certification</p></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">FSSC 22000 is a GFSI-recognized food safety management system certification scheme based on ISO 22000. It provides a framework for managing food safety risks.</p><div class="pt-2"><ul class="space-y-3"><li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(212,168,67,0.5)] shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg>FSSC 22000 for food manufacturing</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(212,168,67,0.5)] shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg>FSSC 22000 for packaging manufacturing</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(212,168,67,0.5)] shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg>FSSC 22000 for storage and distribution</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(212,168,67,0.5)] shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg>Comprehensive audit and certification services</li></ul></div><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 bg-euro-600 text-white heading-font text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest rounded-2xl hover:bg-euro-700 transition shadow-xl mt-2" href="/food-certification/fssc-22000/">Learn More FSSC 22000<i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[9px]"></i></a></div></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-center"><div data-reveal="reveal-left" class="relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-[0_25px_60px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.12)] border border-slate-200 group h-[280px] sm:h-[360px] "><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367673/eurocert/F5.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-1000 group-hover:scale-110" alt="ISO 22000"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#030a16]/60 via-transparent to-transparent"></div><div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5"><span class="inline-block px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md text-eurogold-400 text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] rounded-full border border-eurogold-400/30 heading-font">Food Safety Standard // 05</span></div></div><div data-reveal="reveal-right" data-reveal-delay="200" class="space-y-6 "><div><h3 class="heading-font text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 leading-tight tracking-tight">ISO 22000</h3><p class="heading-font text-euro-600 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mt-1">Certification</p></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">ISO 22000 is an international standard that specifies requirements for a food safety management system. It helps organizations in the food chain ensure food safety.</p><div class="pt-2"><ul class="space-y-3"><li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(212,168,67,0.5)] shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg>Food safety management system implementation</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(212,168,67,0.5)] shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg>ISO 22000 certification audits</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(212,168,67,0.5)] shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg>Training and consultancy services</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(212,168,67,0.5)] shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg>Continuous improvement support</li></ul></div><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 bg-euro-600 text-white heading-font text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest rounded-2xl hover:bg-euro-700 transition shadow-xl mt-2" href="/food-certification/iso-22000/">Learn More ISO 22000<i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[9px]"></i></a></div></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-center"><div data-reveal="reveal-right" class="relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-[0_25px_60px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.12)] border border-slate-200 group h-[280px] sm:h-[360px] md:order-2"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367677/eurocert/F6.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-1000 group-hover:scale-110" alt="FoSTaC"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#030a16]/60 via-transparent to-transparent"></div><div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5"><span class="inline-block px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md text-eurogold-400 text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] rounded-full border border-eurogold-400/30 heading-font">FSSAI Mandated // 06</span></div></div><div data-reveal="reveal-left" data-reveal-delay="200" class="space-y-6 md:order-1"><div><h3 class="heading-font text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 leading-tight tracking-tight">FoSTaC</h3><p class="heading-font text-euro-600 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mt-1">Training</p></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">Food Safety Training and Certification (FoSTaC) is a training program mandated by FSSAI (Food Safety and Standards Aut